bas-c (1.0.1) testing; urgency=medium

  * bas-c-static.pc: link libbas-c.a by path instead of -lbas-c so static
    consumers do not pick up libbas-c.so when both are installed.
  * bas-c-static.pc: declare icu-uc in Requires for one-line static linking.
  * Debian libbas-c-dev: ship libbas-c.a and bas-c-static.pc.
  * icu-config: default icu_major to auto (match pkg-config headers).

